{
  "_comment": [
    "Parallel-citation reconciliation (#160): each vector's printings and the verdicts",
    "stare::parallel::reconcile gives for them (the site calls it through the WASM).",
    "`run` is the index of the first citation of the parallel run a printing is in (its own",
    "index when it starts one or is in none); `lookup` is what the index says of it, a found",
    "one with every case that starts at its page, the first the one a reader opens (#204).",
    "A verdict's `case` is the case a run that agrees opens, which its members share.",
    "When they share more than one case, `tied` lists them, `case` first (#212); it is left out otherwise."
  ],
